<title>USA: BOK Financial to acquire Park Cities.</title>
<headline>BOK Financial to acquire Park Cities.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOK Financial Corp said Thursday it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire  Park Cities Bancshares Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash or debt.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in the first quarter of 1997, BOK, a $4.4 billion asset bank holding company said.</p>
<p>Park Cities has $220 million in assets and has two offices in Dallas, Texas, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
